{"seq":3,"slug":"game-flow-management","title":"游戏流程管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/game-applications/game-flow-management","wordCount":720,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"游戏流程管理\">游戏流程管理</h1><p>游戏流程管理（Game Flow Management）是游戏「宏观状态机」——它控制整个游戏会话从启动到结束的所有顶层状态：加载界面、主菜单、实际游戏、暂停菜单、游戏结束画面等。与角色控制器状态机（毫秒级响应）不同，游戏流程状态机管理的是分钟级的用户旅程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>游戏流程状态机是整个游戏的最顶层状态机，它的设计质量直接影响用户体验的完整性：流程状态不清晰会导致 bug（暂停菜单显示时动画还在播放、游戏结束后还能操控角色），状态切换不当会导致内存泄漏或场景加载卡顿。</p>\n<p>各流程状态的核心职责：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>主要操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Booting</td>\n<td>初始化引擎和核心服务</td>\n<td>加载配置、初始化单例、预加载公共资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MainMenu</td>\n<td>呈现游戏入口</td>\n<td>显示主菜单 UI、播放背景音乐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Loading</td>\n<td>异步加载目标场景</td>\n<td>加载场景+资源、显示进度条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>InGame</td>\n<td>运行实际游戏逻辑</td>\n<td>启用输入、更新所有游戏系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Paused</td>\n<td>冻结游戏世界</td>\n<td>timeScale=0、显示暂停菜单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GameOver</td>\n<td>失败结算</td>\n<td>显示结算 UI、统计数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LevelComplete</td>\n<td>通关结算</td>\n<td>显示通关 UI、解锁下一关</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"标准游戏流程状态集\">标准游戏流程状态集</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Booting&#10;&#10;    Booting --&gt; MainMenu: 初始化完成&#10;    MainMenu --&gt; Loading: 开始游戏 / 加载存档&#10;    Loading --&gt; InGame: 加载完成&#10;    InGame --&gt; Paused: ESC / 手柄 Start 键&#10;    Paused --&gt; InGame: 继续游戏&#10;    Paused --&gt; MainMenu: 返回主菜单&#10;    InGame --&gt; GameOver: 失败条件满足&#10;    InGame --&gt; LevelComplete: 通关条件满足&#10;    GameOver --&gt; Loading: 重试(重载当前关卡)&#10;    GameOver --&gt; MainMenu: 返回主菜单&#10;    LevelComplete --&gt; Loading: 下一关&#10;    LevelComplete --&gt; MainMenu: 主菜单&#10;    MainMenu --&gt; [*]: 退出游戏\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Booting\n\n    Booting --&gt; MainMenu: 初始化完成\n    MainMenu --&gt; Loading: 开始游戏 / 加载存档\n    Loading --&gt; InGame: 加载完成\n    InGame --&gt; Paused: ESC / 手柄 Start 键\n    Paused --&gt; InGame: 继续游戏\n    Paused --&gt; MainMenu: 返回主菜单\n    InGame --&gt; GameOver: 失败条件满足\n    InGame --&gt; LevelComplete: 通关条件满足\n    GameOver --&gt; Loading: 重试(重载当前关卡)\n    GameOver --&gt; MainMenu: 返回主菜单\n    LevelComplete --&gt; Loading: 下一关\n    LevelComplete --&gt; MainMenu: 主菜单\n    MainMenu --&gt; [*]: 退出游戏</pre><h2 id=\"流程状态的实现\">流程状态的实现</h2><p>游戏流程状态机适合用 State Pattern 实现，每个状态独立管理其生命周期：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public abstract class GameState&#10;{&#10;    protected GameFlowManager manager;&#10;&#10;    public GameState(GameFlowManager manager)&#10;    {&#10;        this.manager = manager;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public abstract void OnEnter();&#10;    public abstract void OnUpdate();&#10;    public abstract void OnExit();&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 游戏流程状态机&#10;public class GameFlowManager : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private static GameFlowManager instance;&#10;    public static GameFlowManager Instance =&gt; instance;&#10;&#10;    private GameState currentState;&#10;    private GameState previousState;&#10;&#10;    // 各状态实例&#10;    private BootingState bootingState;&#10;    private MainMenuState mainMenuState;&#10;    private LoadingState loadingState;&#10;    private InGameState inGameState;&#10;    private PausedState pausedState;&#10;    private GameOverState gameOverState;&#10;&#10;    private void Awake()&#10;    {&#10;        if (instance == null)&#10;        {&#10;            instance = this;&#10;            DontDestroyOnLoad(gameObject);&#10;            InitializeStates();&#10;        }&#10;        else&#10;        {&#10;            Destroy(gameObject);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void InitializeStates()&#10;    {&#10;        bootingState = new BootingState(this);&#10;        mainMenuState = new MainMenuState(this);&#10;        loadingState = new LoadingState(this);&#10;        inGameState = new InGameState(this);&#10;        pausedState = new PausedState(this);&#10;        gameOverState = new GameOverState(this);&#10;&#10;        // 从 Booting 开始&#10;        TransitionTo(bootingState);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void TransitionTo(GameState newState)&#10;    {&#10;        previousState = currentState;&#10;        currentState?.OnExit();&#10;        currentState = newState;&#10;        currentState.OnEnter();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void Update() =&gt; currentState?.OnUpdate();&#10;&#10;    // 公开转换方法，供 UI 按钮等调用&#10;    public void StartGame(string levelName)&#10;    {&#10;        loadingState.SetTargetLevel(levelName);&#10;        TransitionTo(loadingState);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void PauseGame()&#10;    {&#10;        if (currentState == inGameState)&#10;            TransitionTo(pausedState);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void ResumeGame()&#10;    {&#10;        if (currentState == pausedState)&#10;            TransitionTo(inGameState);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public abstract class GameState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    protected GameFlowManager manager;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public GameState(GameFlowManager manager)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        this.manager = manager;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public abstract void OnEnter();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public abstract void OnUpdate();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public abstract void OnExit();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 游戏流程状态机</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class GameFlowManager : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private static GameFlowManager instance;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static GameFlowManager Instance => instance;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private GameState currentState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private GameState previousState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 各状态实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private BootingState bootingState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private MainMenuState mainMenuState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private LoadingState loadingState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private InGameState inGameState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private PausedState pausedState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private GameOverState gameOverState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Awake()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (instance == null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            instance = this;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            DontDestroyOnLoad(gameObject);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            InitializeStates();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Destroy(gameObject);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void InitializeStates()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bootingState = new BootingState(this);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        mainMenuState = new MainMenuState(this);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        loadingState = new LoadingState(this);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        inGameState = new InGameState(this);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pausedState = new PausedState(this);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        gameOverState = new GameOverState(this);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 从 Booting 开始</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        TransitionTo(bootingState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void TransitionTo(GameState newState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        previousState = currentState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState?.OnExit();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState = newState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState.OnEnter();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Update() => currentState?.OnUpdate();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 公开转换方法，供 UI 按钮等调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void StartGame(string levelName)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        loadingState.SetTargetLevel(levelName);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        TransitionTo(loadingState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void PauseGame()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (currentState == inGameState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            TransitionTo(pausedState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void ResumeGame()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (currentState == pausedState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            TransitionTo(inGameState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"加载状态的异步实现\">加载状态的异步实现</h2><p>加载状态是流程管理中最复杂的部分，需要处理异步加载、进度显示和加载失败：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class LoadingState : GameState&#10;{&#10;    private string targetLevelName;&#10;    private AsyncOperation loadOperation;&#10;&#10;    public LoadingState(GameFlowManager manager) : base(manager) { }&#10;&#10;    public void SetTargetLevel(string levelName)&#10;    {&#10;        targetLevelName = levelName;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnEnter()&#10;    {&#10;        // 显示加载 UI&#10;        UIManager.Instance.ShowLoadingScreen();&#10;&#10;        // 开始异步加载（不激活场景，等加载完成后手动激活）&#10;        loadOperation = SceneManager.LoadSceneAsync(targetLevelName);&#10;        loadOperation.allowSceneActivation = false;&#10;&#10;        // 并行加载其他资源&#10;        manager.StartCoroutine(LoadAdditionalAssets());&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnUpdate()&#10;    {&#10;        // 更新加载进度条（0-0.9 是加载，0.9-1.0 是激活）&#10;        float progress = loadOperation.progress / 0.9f;&#10;        UIManager.Instance.SetLoadingProgress(progress);&#10;&#10;        // 加载完成（progress &gt;= 0.9 表示准备好激活）&#10;        if (loadOperation.progress &gt;= 0.9f)&#10;        {&#10;            // 可以在这里等待额外的资源加载完成&#10;            if (IsAdditionalAssetsLoaded())&#10;            {&#10;                loadOperation.allowSceneActivation = true;&#10;&#10;                if (loadOperation.isDone)&#10;                {&#10;                    UIManager.Instance.HideLoadingScreen();&#10;                    manager.TransitionTo(manager.InGameState);&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnExit()&#10;    {&#10;        loadOperation = null;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private bool additionalAssetsLoaded = false;&#10;    private bool IsAdditionalAssetsLoaded() =&gt; additionalAssetsLoaded;&#10;&#10;    private IEnumerator LoadAdditionalAssets()&#10;    {&#10;        // 加载音频、配置等&#10;        yield return manager.StartCoroutine(AudioManager.Instance.PreloadLevelAudio(targetLevelName));&#10;        additionalAssetsLoaded = true;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class LoadingState : GameState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private string targetLevelName;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private AsyncOperation loadOperation;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public LoadingState(GameFlowManager manager) : base(manager) { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void SetTargetLevel(string levelName)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        targetLevelName = levelName;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnEnter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 显示加载 UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UIManager.Instance.ShowLoadingScreen();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 开始异步加载（不激活场景，等加载完成后手动激活）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        loadOperation = SceneManager.LoadSceneAsync(targetLevelName);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        loadOperation.allowSceneActivation = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 并行加载其他资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        manager.StartCoroutine(LoadAdditionalAssets());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnUpdate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 更新加载进度条（0-0.9 是加载，0.9-1.0 是激活）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float progress = loadOperation.progress / 0.9f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UIManager.Instance.SetLoadingProgress(progress);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 加载完成（progress >= 0.9 表示准备好激活）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (loadOperation.progress >= 0.9f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 可以在这里等待额外的资源加载完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (IsAdditionalAssetsLoaded())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                loadOperation.allowSceneActivation = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (loadOperation.isDone)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    UIManager.Instance.HideLoadingScreen();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    manager.TransitionTo(manager.InGameState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnExit()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        loadOperation = null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool additionalAssetsLoaded = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool IsAdditionalAssetsLoaded() => additionalAssetsLoaded;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private IEnumerator LoadAdditionalAssets()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 加载音频、配置等</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        yield return manager.StartCoroutine(AudioManager.Instance.PreloadLevelAudio(targetLevelName));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        additionalAssetsLoaded = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"暂停状态的时间控制\">暂停状态的时间控制</h2><p>暂停状态需要冻结游戏世界但保持 UI 可用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class PausedState : GameState&#10;{&#10;    public PausedState(GameFlowManager manager) : base(manager) { }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnEnter()&#10;    {&#10;        // 冻结物理和动画时间&#10;        Time.timeScale = 0f;&#10;&#10;        // 显示暂停 UI&#10;        UIManager.Instance.ShowPauseMenu();&#10;&#10;        // 暂停背景音乐（可选：降低音量而非静音，更有沉浸感）&#10;        AudioManager.Instance.SetMusicPitch(0f);&#10;&#10;        // 触发暂停事件，让各系统响应&#10;        GameEventBus.Publish(new GamePausedEvent());&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnUpdate()&#10;    {&#10;        // 暂停状态下仍需处理 UI 输入&#10;        // Time.unscaledDeltaTime 不受 timeScale 影响&#10;        if (Input.GetButtonDown(&quot;Pause&quot;))&#10;            manager.ResumeGame();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnExit()&#10;    {&#10;        Time.timeScale = 1f;&#10;        AudioManager.Instance.SetMusicPitch(1f);&#10;        UIManager.Instance.HidePauseMenu();&#10;        GameEventBus.Publish(new GameResumedEvent());&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class PausedState : GameState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public PausedState(GameFlowManager manager) : base(manager) { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnEnter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 冻结物理和动画时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Time.timeScale = 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 显示暂停 UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UIManager.Instance.ShowPauseMenu();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 暂停背景音乐（可选：降低音量而非静音，更有沉浸感）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AudioManager.Instance.SetMusicPitch(0f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 触发暂停事件，让各系统响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameEventBus.Publish(new GamePausedEvent());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnUpdate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 暂停状态下仍需处理 UI 输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // Time.unscaledDeltaTime 不受 timeScale 影响</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (Input.GetButtonDown(\"Pause\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            manager.ResumeGame();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnExit()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Time.timeScale = 1f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AudioManager.Instance.SetMusicPitch(1f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UIManager.Instance.HidePauseMenu();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameEventBus.Publish(new GameResumedEvent());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>注意</strong>：<code>Time.timeScale = 0</code> 会影响所有使用 <code>Time.deltaTime</code> 的系统。UI 动画需要使用 <code>Time.unscaledDeltaTime</code> 才能在暂停时正常播放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"存档点与流程状态\">存档点与流程状态</h2><p>存档点（Checkpoint）是游戏流程中的关键设计点，需要保存足以恢复游戏状态的信息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"[Serializable]&#10;public class GameSaveData&#10;{&#10;    public string LevelName;&#10;    public string CheckpointId;&#10;    public float PlayerHealth;&#10;    public Vector3 PlayerPosition;&#10;    public Quaternion PlayerRotation;&#10;    public Dictionary&lt;string, bool&gt; GameFlags; // 任务完成、门已开等状态&#10;    public float PlayTime;&#10;    public DateTime SaveTime;&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class CheckpointManager : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private GameSaveData currentSaveData;&#10;&#10;    public void TriggerCheckpoint(string checkpointId, Transform playerTransform)&#10;    {&#10;        currentSaveData = new GameSaveData&#10;        {&#10;            LevelName = SceneManager.GetActiveScene().name,&#10;            CheckpointId = checkpointId,&#10;            PlayerHealth = PlayerController.Instance.Health,&#10;            PlayerPosition = playerTransform.position,&#10;            PlayerRotation = playerTransform.rotation,&#10;            GameFlags = GameStateTracker.Instance.GetAllFlags(),&#10;            PlayTime = StatsTracker.Instance.TotalPlayTime,&#10;            SaveTime = DateTime.Now&#10;        };&#10;&#10;        SaveToFile(currentSaveData);&#10;        UIManager.Instance.ShowCheckpointSavedIndicator();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public IEnumerator LoadFromCheckpoint(GameSaveData saveData)&#10;    {&#10;        // 在 Loading 状态中调用&#10;        yield return SceneManager.LoadSceneAsync(saveData.LevelName);&#10;&#10;        // 场景加载完成后恢复状态&#10;        PlayerController.Instance.Health = saveData.PlayerHealth;&#10;        PlayerController.Instance.Teleport(&#10;            saveData.PlayerPosition, saveData.PlayerRotation);&#10;        GameStateTracker.Instance.RestoreFlags(saveData.GameFlags);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[Serializable]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class GameSaveData</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string LevelName;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string CheckpointId;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float PlayerHealth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Vector3 PlayerPosition;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Quaternion PlayerRotation;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Dictionary&#x3C;string, bool> GameFlags; // 任务完成、门已开等状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float PlayTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public DateTime SaveTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class CheckpointManager : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private GameSaveData currentSaveData;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void TriggerCheckpoint(string checkpointId, Transform playerTransform)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentSaveData = new GameSaveData</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            LevelName = SceneManager.GetActiveScene().name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            CheckpointId = checkpointId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            PlayerHealth = PlayerController.Instance.Health,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            PlayerPosition = playerTransform.position,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            PlayerRotation = playerTransform.rotation,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            GameFlags = GameStateTracker.Instance.GetAllFlags(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            PlayTime = StatsTracker.Instance.TotalPlayTime,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            SaveTime = DateTime.Now</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        SaveToFile(currentSaveData);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UIManager.Instance.ShowCheckpointSavedIndicator();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public IEnumerator LoadFromCheckpoint(GameSaveData saveData)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 在 Loading 状态中调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        yield return SceneManager.LoadSceneAsync(saveData.LevelName);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 场景加载完成后恢复状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        PlayerController.Instance.Health = saveData.PlayerHealth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        PlayerController.Instance.Teleport(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            saveData.PlayerPosition, saveData.PlayerRotation);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameStateTracker.Instance.RestoreFlags(saveData.GameFlags);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"场景切换的状态一致性\">场景切换的状态一致性</h2><p>跨场景切换时，需要保证游戏流程状态机本身不被销毁（<code>DontDestroyOnLoad</code>），同时确保场景内的游戏对象能正确响应流程状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 注册到游戏流程事件&#10;public class SceneLevelManager : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private void OnEnable()&#10;    {&#10;        GameEventBus.Subscribe&lt;GamePausedEvent&gt;(OnGamePaused);&#10;        GameEventBus.Subscribe&lt;GameResumedEvent&gt;(OnGameResumed);&#10;        GameEventBus.Subscribe&lt;GameOverEvent&gt;(OnGameOver);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnDisable()&#10;    {&#10;        GameEventBus.Unsubscribe&lt;GamePausedEvent&gt;(OnGamePaused);&#10;        GameEventBus.Unsubscribe&lt;GameResumedEvent&gt;(OnGameResumed);&#10;        GameEventBus.Unsubscribe&lt;GameOverEvent&gt;(OnGameOver);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnGamePaused(GamePausedEvent e)&#10;    {&#10;        // 暂停场景内所有 NPC&#10;        foreach (var npc in FindObjectsOfType&lt;NPCController&gt;())&#10;            npc.Pause();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 注册到游戏流程事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class SceneLevelManager : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnEnable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameEventBus.Subscribe&#x3C;GamePausedEvent>(OnGamePaused);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameEventBus.Subscribe&#x3C;GameResumedEvent>(OnGameResumed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameEventBus.Subscribe&#x3C;GameOverEvent>(OnGameOver);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnDisable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameEventBus.Unsubscribe&#x3C;GamePausedEvent>(OnGamePaused);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameEventBus.Unsubscribe&#x3C;GameResumedEvent>(OnGameResumed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameEventBus.Unsubscribe&#x3C;GameOverEvent>(OnGameOver);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnGamePaused(GamePausedEvent e)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 暂停场景内所有 NPC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var npc in FindObjectsOfType&#x3C;NPCController>())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            npc.Pause();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>游戏流程管理状态机是整个游戏体验的骨架。核心要点：用 <code>DontDestroyOnLoad</code> 保证状态机跨场景持久，异步加载时用 <code>allowSceneActivation</code> 控制激活时机，暂停时用 <code>Time.timeScale = 0</code> 冻结游戏世界（UI 用 <code>unscaledDeltaTime</code>），用事件总线解耦流程状态与场景内对象的通信。</p>\n<p><strong>同章节其他内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"character-controller-states\">角色控制器状态</a> — InGame 状态下活跃的角色控制器设计</li>\n<li><a href=\"animation-state-machines\">动画状态机</a> — 流程状态变化时动画系统的暂停与恢复</li>\n<li><a href=\"../advanced/pushdown-automata\">下推自动机与状态栈</a> — 多层菜单覆盖的进阶解决方案，是流程管理的延伸</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"游戏流程管理","id":"游戏流程管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"标准游戏流程状态集","id":"标准游戏流程状态集"},{"level":2,"text":"流程状态的实现","id":"流程状态的实现"},{"level":2,"text":"加载状态的异步实现","id":"加载状态的异步实现"},{"level":2,"text":"暂停状态的时间控制","id":"暂停状态的时间控制"},{"level":2,"text":"存档点与流程状态","id":"存档点与流程状态"},{"level":2,"text":"场景切换的状态一致性","id":"场景切换的状态一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"动画状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/game-applications/animation-state-machines"},"next":{"title":"下推自动机与状态栈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/advanced/pushdown-automata"}}